### 2. Submit Rating (Will return 400 until status becomes 'picked_up')
POST http://localhost/unibite/api/ratings/submit.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "request_id": 1,
  "score": 5,
  "comment": "Εξαιρετικό φαγητό, ευχαριστώ πολύ!"
}